OL,3,GNEWSAStormont ministers to hold
OL,4,A'urgent' meeting on budget stalemate
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorthern Ireland Secretary Sir Chris
OL,7,FBryant last week instructed his
OL,8,Fofficials to consider "contingency
OL,9,Fplans" after a deadline passed for
OL,10,Fministers to consider a "final offer"
OL,11,Fof #1.5bn extra money.
OL,13,FFinance Minister John O'Dowd said he
OL,14,Fhad asked his colleagues to hold an
OL,15,F"urgent executive meeting so we can
OL,16,Festablish a position to go back with to
OL,17,Fthe British government".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
